      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "bridle made from knotted rope or leather",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "厩舎の壁に掛けられた面綱を手に取り、厩番は馬の頭にそっとかけてやった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "馬が興奮して暴れ出したので、騎手は面綱をしっかり握りしめて宥めようとした。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古い面綱は革が硬化していたため、出発前に新しいものと取り替えた。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "面ヅラ「面綱」の訛りで、馬の額から頤下にまはして結んだ綱である。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "津軽地方特有の俚諺",
                "author": "福士幸次郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "馬の面綱に似てゐるからだと説明されてゐる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "津軽地方特有の俚諺",
                "author": "福士幸次郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "index": 2,
        "gloss": "multi-coloured rope ceremonial garland, placed on cattle, large rocks, etc.",
        "register": "standard",
